{"3345950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Capote", "steam_appid": 3345950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone knows that corner dive bar where the card table becomes the center of the universe. Capote brings that bar to your screen: a card game for 1 to 6 people that takes classic card games, reinvents them, and throws a heavy dose of chaos on top. Three modes, a cast of characters you could swear you've met before, and always that one card that flips everything upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/feff7bb1b4490260412533577ce0fd6f.avif?t=1788099010\" width=1056 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/137f4fd4240aa887440f10b661c5c17f.poster.avif?t=1788099010\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/137f4fd4240aa887440f10b661c5c17f.webm?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/137f4fd4240aa887440f10b661c5c17f.mp4?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bet how many times you think you'll win, then play your cards to hit that number exactly. Won or lost more than you bet? The math is simple: one virtual shot per mistake. Rack up four, and you're out. Adjust the match rules with your friends, or bring in bots to practice solo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/79a8ec9d2a6730901ffd82c4625879a6.avif?t=1788099010\" width=1056 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/59c20462cc69cfa8c87b2e8e6533307f.poster.avif?t=1788099010\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/59c20462cc69cfa8c87b2e8e6533307f.webm?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/59c20462cc69cfa8c87b2e8e6533307f.mp4?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The back of the bar is where things get serious. In solo mode, build the best combination of powers and face off against Capote's characters in blackjack duels. Lost a run? Clear the table and start over, making different choices until you finally reach Bete herself. It's classic blackjack, but with a roguelike twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/e7a71de8def088df147acd0287006201.avif?t=1788099010\" width=1056 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/3d362fdf3e680361d60ba376e2202172.poster.avif?t=1788099010\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/3d362fdf3e680361d60ba376e2202172.webm?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/3d362fdf3e680361d60ba376e2202172.mp4?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your team and jump into a classic truco match, your way: solo or in pairs. Trade signals with emotes, play with strategy, and score points to win. What matters is keeping the table loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/79d34d32bf2c0cfe9c485f32647f6413.avif?t=1788099010\" width=1056 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/822c52674c9c80fa496227e6675f45fc.poster.avif?t=1788099010\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/822c52674c9c80fa496227e6675f45fc.webm?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/822c52674c9c80fa496227e6675f45fc.mp4?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends into an online table for up to 6, and let the chaos run wild with in-game chat to talk trash all you want. It's the atmosphere of a real neighborhood dive bar, with all the mess that comes with it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To sum it up:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 to 6 players, online PvP or solo against bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three modes available: Capote, Betejack, and Truco</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit the rules to customize every match your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 characters straight out of the neighborhood bar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a quick round of pool while you wait for others to join the lobby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube integration that lets you play your favorite artists during matches</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone knows that corner dive bar where the card table becomes the center of the universe. Capote brings that bar to your screen: a card game for 1 to 6 people that takes classic card games, reinvents them, and throws a heavy dose of chaos on top. Three modes, a cast of characters you could swear you've met before, and always that one card that flips everything upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/feff7bb1b4490260412533577ce0fd6f.avif?t=1788099010\" width=1056 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/137f4fd4240aa887440f10b661c5c17f.poster.avif?t=1788099010\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/137f4fd4240aa887440f10b661c5c17f.webm?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345950/extras/137f4fd4240aa887440f10b661c5c17f.mp4?t=1788099010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bet how many times you think you'll win, then play your cards to hit that number exactly. Won or lost more than you bet? The math is simple: one virtual shot per mistake. Rack up four, and you're out. Adjust the match rules with your friends, or bring in bots to practice solo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset